classDiagram
class ShareGrant {
  +UUID id
  +UUID reportId
  +Long ownerId
  +String tokenHash
  +Date expiresAt
  +Date revokedAt
  +isAccessible(now)
  +revoke()
}
class DeletionRequest {
  +UUID id
  +UUID sessionId
  +Long ownerId
  +DeletionState state
  +Date deadline
  +registerReceipt(context)
  +complete()
}
class PurgeReceipt {
  +UUID id
  +String context
  +Date completedAt
  +acknowledge()
}
DeletionRequest "1" *-- "0..*" PurgeReceipt : confirma
ShareGrant ..> DeletionRequest : bloqueado por tombstone
